{"ref":"BDB, עֵשָׂו","hw":"עֵשָׂו","html":"<big><span dir=\"rtl\">עֵשָׂו</span></big><sub>97</sub>  <strong>n.pr.m. Esau</strong>, Ησαυ;—<em>Esau</em>, elder son of Isaac <a data-ref=\"Genesis 25:25\" href=\"/Genesis.25.25\">Gn 25:25</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 25:26\" href=\"/Genesis.25.26\">26</a> + 7 times <a data-ref=\"Genesis 25:25\" href=\"/Genesis.25.25\">25</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 26:34\" href=\"/Genesis.26.34\">26:34</a>; <a data-ref=\"Genesis 27:1\" href=\"/Genesis.27.1\">27:1</a> + 24 times 27, 28; <a data-ref=\"Genesis 32:4\" href=\"/Genesis.32.4\">32:4</a> + 15 times <a data-ref=\"Genesis 32\" href=\"/Genesis.32\">32</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 33\" href=\"/Genesis.33\">33</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 35\" href=\"/Genesis.35\">35</a>; <a data-ref=\"Joshua 24:4\" href=\"/Joshua.24.4\">Jos 24:4</a><sup>(×2)</sup> <a data-ref=\"Malachi 1:2\" href=\"/Malachi.1.2\">Mal 1:2</a>, <a data-ref=\"Malachi 1:3\" href=\"/Malachi.1.3\">3</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 1:34\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.1.34\">1 Ch 1:34</a>; identif. with <span dir=\"rtl\">אֱדוֹם</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 36:1\" href=\"/Genesis.36.1\">Gn 36:1</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 36:8\" href=\"/Genesis.36.8\">8</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 36:19\" href=\"/Genesis.36.19\">19</a>, ancestor of Edomites v <a data-ref=\"Genesis 36:9\" href=\"/Genesis.36.9\">9</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 36:43\" href=\"/Genesis.36.43\">43</a>, cf. <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 1:35\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.1.35\">1 Ch 1:35</a>; dwelling in Mt. Seir <a data-ref=\"Genesis 36:8\" href=\"/Genesis.36.8\">Gn 36:8</a> (25 times in all, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 36\" href=\"/Genesis.36\">Gn 36</a>) <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 2:5\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.2.5\">Dt 2:5</a>; <a data-ref=\"Joshua 24:4\" href=\"/Joshua.24.4\">Jos 24:4</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּנֵי עֵשָׂו</span> = Edomites <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 2:4\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.2.4\">Dt 2:4</a>, <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 2:8\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.2.8\">8</a>, <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 2:12\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.2.12\">12</a>, <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 2:22\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.2.22\">22</a>, <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 2:29\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.2.29\">29</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">עֵשָׂו</span> = Edom <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 49:8\" href=\"/Jeremiah.49.8\">Je 49:8</a>; <a data-ref=\"Obadiah 1:6\" href=\"/Obadiah.1.6\">Ob 6</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">בֵּית עֵשָׂו</span> v <a data-ref=\"Obadiah 1:18\" href=\"/Obadiah.1.18\">18</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, <span dir=\"rtl\">הַר עֵשָׂו</span> v <a data-ref=\"Obadiah 1:8\" href=\"/Obadiah.1.8\">8</a>, <a data-ref=\"Obadiah 1:9\" href=\"/Obadiah.1.9\">9</a>, <a data-ref=\"Obadiah 1:19\" href=\"/Obadiah.1.19\">19</a>, <a data-ref=\"Obadiah 1:21\" href=\"/Obadiah.1.21\">21</a>.","next":"BDB, עָשַׂק","prev":"BDB, עָשָׂה²"}